{"id":"d2e1d180cc0ebd2e","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal.md","title":"很强相等与对角子类型","display":"thm-equality-subset-diagonal — 很强相等与对角子类型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal","aliases":["16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal"],"display":"thm-equality-subset-diagonal — 很强相等与对角子类型","depends_on":["[[16-df-subset-type]]","[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","[[16-df-internal-equality]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Proposition4.9.3 pp.306–307 (PDF326–327)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-equality-subset-diagonal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-equality-subset-diagonal — 很强相等与对角子类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92bb081cf777d22b\" href=\"?note=92bb081cf777d22b\" title=\"16-df-subset-type\">16-df-subset-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition4.9.3 pp.306–307 (PDF326–327)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92bb081cf777d22b\" href=\"?note=92bb081cf777d22b\" title=\"16-df-subset-type\">16-df-subset-type</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\">\\(\\mathrm{VStrongEq}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2143c499aae70cc\" href=\"?note=f2143c499aae70cc\" title=\"16-df-very-strong-equality\">16-df-very-strong-equality</a> 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eq}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Eq}_p\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"93b3305f115fb8fd\" href=\"?note=93b3305f115fb8fd\" title=\"16-df-internal-equality\">16-df-internal-equality</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_I,\\delta_I\">\\(e_I,\\delta_I\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_I\">\\(\\kappa_I\\)</span> 如下定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\times I\">\\(I\\times I\\)</span> 的所选投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_I\">\\(\\kappa_I\\)</span> 是下文由唯一因子条件确定的箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ne_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2),\\qquad\n\\delta_I\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\{\\kappa_I\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,\\{e_I\\})\\mid\\pi_{e_I}h=\\delta_I\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\kappa_I).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ne_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Eq}_p(\\pi_1,\\pi_2),\\qquad\n\\delta_I\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\n\\{\\kappa_I\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,\\{e_I\\})\\mid\\pi_{e_I}h=\\delta_I\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{VStrongEq}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(\\kappa_I).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反身性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_I\\le\\delta_I^*e_I\">\\(\\top_I\\le\\delta_I^*e_I\\)</span>，子类型泛性质给唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_I\">\\(\\kappa_I\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_I\">\\(\\kappa_I\\)</span> 可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_K\\le\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\">\\(\\top_K\\le\\operatorname{Eq}_p(u,v)\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\)</span> 经对角线分解，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\">\\(u=v\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\pi_1\\pi_{e_I}\">\\(d=\\pi_1\\pi_{e_I}\\)</span>。有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\kappa_I=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(d\\kappa_I=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。由子类型泛性质，两个投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1\\pi_{e_I},\\pi_2\\pi_{e_I}\">\\(\\pi_1\\pi_{e_I},\\pi_2\\pi_{e_I}\\)</span> 内部相等；很强相等使它们外部相等。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{e_I}\\kappa_Id=\\delta_Id=\\pi_{e_I}\">\\(\\pi_{e_I}\\kappa_Id=\\delta_Id=\\pi_{e_I}\\)</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{e_I}\">\\(\\pi_{e_I}\\)</span> 单态射得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_Id=\\operatorname{id}\">\\(\\kappa_Id=\\operatorname{id}\\)</span>。这完整复现原书证明，并给出实际逆箭头。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-subset-type","status":"resolved","id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subset-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-very-strong-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subset-type","status":"resolved","id":"92bb081cf777d22b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"假设 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-subset-type]]。$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 是 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]] 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$e_I,\\delta_I$ 及 $\\kappa_I$ 如下定义，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $I\\times I$ 的所选投影。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-very-strong-equality","status":"resolved","id":"f2143c499aae70cc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"假设 $\\mathsf{SubsetComp}(p,\\chi)$，采用 [[16-df-subset-type]]。$\\mathrm{VStrongEq}$ 是 [[16-df-very-strong-equality]] 中待刻画的谓词，未预先假设成立；$\\operatorname{Eq}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-internal-equality]]。$e_I,\\delta_I$ 及 $\\kappa_I$ 如下定义，$\\pi_1,\\pi_2$ 为 $I\\times I$ 的所选投影。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-internal-equality","status":"resolved","id":"93b3305f115fb8fd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","lo